{"seq":2,"slug":"fund-transfer-pricing-interest","title":"内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/fund-transfer-pricing-interest","wordCount":2164,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"内部资金转移定价-ftp-与利息\">内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息</h1><p>资金池把成员的钱集中起来之后，必须回答一个看似简单的问题：<strong>成员 A 的钱被拿走给成员 B 用了，A 应该收到多少利息、B 应该支付多少利息？</strong> 这个问题若没有一个统一、可解释、可审计的规则，整个资金池会从&quot;优化集团资金效率&quot;退化成&quot;成员之间互相侵占&quot;——A 会把钱藏到体外，B 会无限度占用，集团反而失去了资金。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>内部资金转移定价（Funds Transfer Pricing，FTP）是集团内部的资金价格体系：集团司库（或内部银行）作为中心方，向资金盈余的成员（资金提供方）支付存款利率，向资金缺口的成员（资金使用方）收取贷款利率。中心方自己不赚取利差或仅赚取管理费，其作用是<strong>把利率风险与流动性风险从业务单元剥离到中心统一管理</strong>。</p>\n<p>美联储等监管机构对银行实施 FTP 的期望给出了清晰的表述：FTP 是管理资产负债表结构与衡量风险调整后盈利能力的重要工具，用于把<strong>融资风险（含利率与流动性成分）与或有流动性风险</strong>分配到业务条线、产品与活动上，从而影响新业务的规模与条款；有效的 FTP 应使企业能够<strong>把这些风险转移到一个中心管理职能</strong>，以利用自然对冲、集中对冲与公司整体视角（见 <a href=\"https://www.federalreserve.gov/supervisionreg/srletters/SR1603.htm\">SR 16-3 联署监管指引</a>）。集团司库的 FTP 与银行 FTP 在原理上同源，只是&quot;业务线&quot;换成了&quot;成员企业&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[资金盈余成员 A] --&gt;|按存款利率计息| C[集团司库/内部银行]&#10;    B[资金缺口成员 B] --&gt;|按贷款利率计息| C&#10;    C --&gt; D[资金成本基础 FTP 曲线]&#10;    C --&gt; E[流动性溢价]&#10;    C --&gt; F[风险与期限调整]&#10;    D --&gt; G[存款利率 = 曲线 - 调整]&#10;    D --&gt; H[贷款利率 = 曲线 + 调整]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    C --&gt; I[中心方利差 或 管理费]\">graph TD\n    A[资金盈余成员 A] --&gt;|按存款利率计息| C[集团司库/内部银行]\n    B[资金缺口成员 B] --&gt;|按贷款利率计息| C\n    C --&gt; D[资金成本基础 FTP 曲线]\n    C --&gt; E[流动性溢价]\n    C --&gt; F[风险与期限调整]\n    D --&gt; G[存款利率 = 曲线 - 调整]\n    D --&gt; H[贷款利率 = 曲线 + 调整]\n    E --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; H\n    C --&gt; I[中心方利差 或 管理费]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>决定因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础曲线</td>\n<td>无风险资金成本</td>\n<td>市场基准利率、集团融资成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流动性溢价</td>\n<td>期限错配的价格</td>\n<td>期限、市场流动性状况</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信用调整</td>\n<td>借款方信用差异</td>\n<td>成员信用状况、担保安排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>管理费</td>\n<td>中心方运营成本</td>\n<td>归集规模、服务复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务调整</td>\n<td>扣除资格差异</td>\n<td>成员可扣除空间（见资本弱化）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ftp-曲线的构建\">FTP 曲线的构建</h2><h3 id=\"基准的选择\">基准的选择</h3><p>FTP 曲线的起点是&quot;集团在市场上获得这笔资金的边际成本&quot;。可选基准有三类：<strong>无风险利率曲线</strong>（如隔夜担保融资利率或其替代基准）、<strong>集团自身发行债券的收益率曲线</strong>、<strong>集团实际加权平均资金成本（WACF）</strong>。</p>\n<p>三者的差别在于是否包含集团自身信用。用无风险曲线，FTP 不含信用成分，成员借款价格偏低，集团整体承担的信用成本无处体现；用 WACF，FTP 含平均信用成本，简单但忽略了新增融资的边际成本。实务上多数集团用<strong>边际融资成本曲线</strong>：按不同期限在市场上实际可获得的利率构建曲线，再对成员加信用调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"期限与流动性溢价\">期限与流动性溢价</h3><p>曲线上每个期限点的利率不同，长期资金价格高于短期。把成员的资金按实际占用期限定价，是 FTP 最重要的功能——它让&quot;长期占用&quot;变得昂贵，从而抑制成员对长期资金的过度需求。若不做期限区分，所有资金按同一个利率定价，成员会倾向于借长期资金做短期用途，把期限风险留给中心方。</p>\n<h3 id=\"存款侧与贷款侧的对称性\">存款侧与贷款侧的对称性</h3><p>存款利率与贷款利率通常共享同一条曲线，但两侧的调整方向相反：存款利率 = 曲线 − 流动性折价（因为成员提供的是可随时抽走的资金，中心方承担了不确定性），贷款利率 = 曲线 + 流动性溢价 + 信用调整。两侧的差即为中心方的毛利差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计息机制与账务\">计息机制与账务</h2><h3 id=\"计息基础与日算规则\">计息基础与日算规则</h3><p>内部计息的第一组工程决定是<strong>计息基础</strong>（计息天数与年基数的组合）。常见约定为 actual/360（货币市场惯例）、actual/365（多数本币市场）、30/360（部分债券市场）。同一笔资金用不同基础算出的利息差别可观，必须逐币种明确约定，否则成员之间的对账永远对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Interest</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Principal</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>Rate</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mtext>Actual Days</mtext><mtext>Year Basis</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Interest} = \\text{Principal} \\times \\text{Rate} \\times \\frac{\\text{Actual Days}}{\\text{Year Basis}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Interest</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Principal</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Year Basis</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Actual Days</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"计息的触发与轧差\">计息的触发与轧差</h3><p>资金池内的头寸是浮动的，计息必须落在明确的余额快照上。常见做法是以日终归集后的余额为计息基准，或按日间平均余额计息。前者的实现简单且与银行归集动作对齐，但可能被成员通过在归集时点前临时划走资金规避利息支出；后者更难规避但需要更高频的余额采集。</p>\n<p>利息可以逐笔实付，也可以累计后与本金一起轧差。逐笔实付的现金流笔数多但清晰；累计轧差的运营成本低但对账难度大。多数资金池选择按周期（月或季）累计并轧差，配合<a href=\"../position-netting-liquidity/multicurrency-position-netting\">多币种头寸与双边/多边净额</a>的净额结算一并执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH daily AS (&#10;  SELECT entity_code, currency, balance_date,&#10;         closing_balance,&#10;         LEAD(closing_balance, 1, closing_balance)&#10;           OVER (PARTITION BY entity_code, currency ORDER BY balance_date) AS next_balance&#10;  FROM pool_daily_balance&#10;  WHERE balance_date BETWEEN DATE &#39;2026-09-01&#39; AND DATE &#39;2026-09-30&#39;&#10;),&#10;accrual AS (&#10;  SELECT d.entity_code, d.currency,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN d.closing_balance &gt; 0 THEN&#10;               d.closing_balance * cr.deposit_rate&#10;               * (DATE &#39;2026-09-30&#39; - d.balance_date + 1) / 360.0&#10;             ELSE 0 END) AS deposit_interest,&#10;         SUM(CASE WHEN d.closing_balance &lt; 0 THEN&#10;               ABS(d.closing_balance) * cr.loan_rate&#10;               * (DATE &#39;2026-09-30&#39; - d.balance_date + 1) / 360.0&#10;             ELSE 0 END) AS loan_interest&#10;  FROM daily d&#10;  JOIN ftp_rate_curve cr&#10;    ON cr.currency = d.currency&#10;   AND cr.effective_date = d.balance_date&#10;   AND cr.tenor = &#39;overnight&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY d.entity_code, d.currency&#10;)&#10;SELECT entity_code, currency,&#10;       ROUND(deposit_interest, 2)  AS deposit_interest,&#10;       ROUND(loan_interest, 2)     AS loan_interest,&#10;       ROUND(deposit_interest - loan_interest, 2) AS net_interest&#10;FROM accrual&#10;ORDER BY currency, net_interest DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_code, currency, balance_date,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         closing_balance,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         LEAD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(closing_balance, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, closing_balance)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_code, currency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool_daily_balance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-01'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-30'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">accrual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closing_balance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">               d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closing_balance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deposit_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-30'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">balance_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 360</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deposit_interest,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closing_balance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">               ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closing_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">loan_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">               *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-09-30'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">balance_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 360</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loan_interest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ftp_rate_curve cr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">balance_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tenor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'overnight'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entity_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entity_code, currency,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(deposit_interest, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deposit_interest,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(loan_interest, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loan_interest,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(deposit_interest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loan_interest, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_interest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accrual</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currency, net_interest </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询把逐日余额按当日的 FTP 曲线累积成月度利息，<code>net_interest</code> 为正表示该成员是净资金提供方（应收取利息），为负表示净使用方（应支付利息）。实现的要点是 <code>ftp_rate_curve</code> 必须按日可取——利率变动时曲线随之变动，而不是全月用同一个利率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与税务口径的衔接\">与税务口径的衔接</h3><p>前面提到，同一笔内部借款在不同成员的税后成本不同（见<a href=\"intercompany-loan-capitalization\">多实体内部借贷与资本弱化</a>）。FTP 定价若只看资金成本、不看税务维度，会出现&quot;税后成本倒挂&quot;：税率高且可扣除空间充足的成员实际税后成本很低，却被按统一利率收费，反而抑制了它应有的资金使用。</p>\n<p>处理方式不是把税率直接塞进 FTP 利率（那会让 FTP 曲线失去可比性），而是<strong>在 FTP 之外单独计量税务成本</strong>，作为成员绩效的独立一栏。这样 FTP 保持纯净（只反映资金与风险），税务影响另行呈现，两者在管理报表中合并解读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理与执行要点\">治理与执行要点</h2><h3 id=\"曲线制定权与变更流程\">曲线制定权与变更流程</h3><p>FTP 曲线必须由集团司库统一制定，成员不得自行协商。变更需要留痕：曲线的基准、参数、生效日期、审批记录。这一条不是形式要求——成员之间对内部利率有争议时，可追溯的曲线制定流程是唯一的裁决依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与外部银行的映射\">与外部银行的映射</h3><p>内部银行的对外融资成本是对外谈判的结果，FTP 曲线需要定期与外部融资实际成本校准。若 FTP 曲线长期低于集团的边际融资成本，成员会低估资金成本、过度使用资金，最终由集团承担利差亏损。定期校准的频率通常与集团融资结构的变动同步。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一利率覆盖所有期限</td>\n<td>成员过度借长期资金</td>\n<td>按占用期限分层定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只看资金成本不看风险</td>\n<td>信用差的成员定价过低</td>\n<td>加信用与流动性调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曲线长期不校准</td>\n<td>与市场脱节，形成隐性补贴</td>\n<td>定期与外部融资成本对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把税务直接混入 FTP</td>\n<td>曲线失去可比性</td>\n<td>税务成本单独计量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>FTP 的作用是把融资风险与流动性风险从成员剥离到中心方统一管理，同时为资金提供方与使用方提供可解释的价格。</li>\n<li>曲线的起点是集团在市场上的边际融资成本，含基础曲线、流动性溢价、信用调整与管理费。</li>\n<li>存款侧与贷款侧共享曲线但调整方向相反，两侧之差即中心方毛利差。</li>\n<li>计息基础（actual/360、actual/365、30/360）必须逐币种明确约定，否则对账无法收敛。</li>\n<li>逐日按当日曲线累积计息，利率变动时曲线随之变动，而非全月固定。</li>\n<li>税务成本不混入 FTP 利率，单独计量后在管理报表中合并解读。</li>\n<li>曲线制定权归集团司库，变更需留痕，并定期与外部融资成本校准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内部资金转移定价（FTP）与利息","id":"内部资金转移定价-ftp-与利息"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"FTP 曲线的构建","id":"ftp-曲线的构建"},{"level":3,"text":"基准的选择","id":"基准的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"期限与流动性溢价","id":"期限与流动性溢价"},{"level":3,"text":"存款侧与贷款侧的对称性","id":"存款侧与贷款侧的对称性"},{"level":2,"text":"计息机制与账务","id":"计息机制与账务"},{"level":3,"text":"计息基础与日算规则","id":"计息基础与日算规则"},{"level":3,"text":"计息的触发与轧差","id":"计息的触发与轧差"},{"level":3,"text":"与税务口径的衔接","id":"与税务口径的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"治理与执行要点","id":"治理与执行要点"},{"level":3,"text":"曲线制定权与变更流程","id":"曲线制定权与变更流程"},{"level":3,"text":"与外部银行的映射","id":"与外部银行的映射"},{"level":3,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多实体内部借贷与资本弱化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/intercompany-loan-capitalization"},"next":{"title":"银行账户体系与签约行/签字权管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/intercompany-funding-transfer/bank-account-signatory-structure"}}